lse, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e314311aff773055a08bfb8a07333e746f2be8d", "message": "Refactoring", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:32:32Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "949b197eec26d5cc5bd3efc8c86858ff4ae97ea3", "message": "Refactoring: authorization module, configuration validation, and error handling\n\n- Authorization in system/auth/ for reuse\n- Added configuration validation at application startup\n- Implemented global error handlers and error pages", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:03:32Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4ab7b6aef7b4898b75ac0fddeb7e082650179001", "message": "Update README", "created_at": "2026-01-22T10:32:37Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e077bfdfd35f0a09cfaa63bea6773cd1653dabad", "message": "Refactoring: Auth module, Docs", "created_at": "2026-01-22T10:08:41Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d9402e6d2561c6023347b0095bf9dc83d7e7da3", "message": "Refactoring: Application Factory, Blueprints, Validation, and Graceful Shutdown\n\n- Refactoring to Application Factory pattern\n- Moved routes to Blueprints (main, counters, reports, settings)\n- Added input validation for POST requests\n- Fixed thread stopping correctly in ThreadManager\n- Added graceful shutdown with signal handlers\n- Updated all url_for in blueprints templates\n- Added the close() method to the DatabaseManager", "created_at": "2026-01-22T09:45:50Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6687dc0cf98eca064f264d5ad6bc55b84ed22bc2", "message": "1. ObjectCounter has added logging for exceptions when the connection to the camera is lost, but by default it is commented out so as not to load the disk.\n2. ObjectDetectionYOLO has been updated with the functionality of clearing resources", "created_at": "2026-01-14T07:06:01Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e35faefc1dc07dacde0a20c5a90b5e35a29fd0b", "message": "1. The mechanism for creating a counting area has been optimized.\n2. Updated logging class\n3. Updated translations", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:00:36Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "70cc624ad83bf22eaeeaaceb60ecbad006a0d8dc", "message": "Merge pull request #48 from BespredeL/develop\n\ndevelop", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:26:51Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b247ac978619e2f993d225b976960eb2c6ca00f", "message": "1. Add video recorder", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:26:01Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "38b25573369ecf3eee6ad5634874ad7943f67753", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into develop\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\trequirements.txt", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:19:59Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "974de1306cc69594cb28e6f7032ec59fc4758497", "message": "1. Updated requirements\n2. Added functionality for recording video with recognition results:\n - In the configuration file, the recording key with default parameters has been added to detection_default. You can reset these parameters for each recognition point in detections\n - Video recording starts when the system recognizes an object in the specified area, and stops recording when recognition stops or the counter is reset", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:25:43Z", "repo": "CVCounter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e651f8b61b0890493e05c87901de7f4f8369f1b", "message": "1. Small fixes template\n2. Upgrade packages ver